<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '60px', fontFamily: '"Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif', position: 'relative' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16202E' }}>三层结构：内容、权限、证据各归其位</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B7899', marginTop: 10 }}>方案</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#D8DEE7', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 26, alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 780, background: '#12294D', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 26px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 22 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C08A3E', width: 46 }}>03</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>证据层 · 说得清</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C2D2E6', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>访问、下载、外发、审批逐条留痕；哈希链防篡改，可按人、按对象、按时间举证。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 900, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #1B3B6F', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 26px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 22 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1B3B6F', width: 46 }}>02</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1B3B6F' }}>权限层 · 管得住</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3E5875', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>权限挂在对象上：六个档位、十五个原子位；密级先于权限生效，继承可断可续。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1020, background: '#F4F6F9', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 26px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 22 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#5B7899', width: 46 }}>01</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16202E' }}>内容层 · 存得住</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5B6E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>文件、版本、格式收在一处；同一内容只存一份，改一次生成一个版本，历史可回退。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 26, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 20, background: '#C08A3E' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#16202E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            三层不是三个模块，而是三种保证：<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>存得住、管得住、说得清</span>——缺任何一层，另外两层都立不住。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, top: 676, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A9BB2' }}>NeuroDMS · 产品概览</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A9BB2' }}>03</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
